      "id": "licence",
      "rule": "GPL without AGPL",
      "description": "The page names both GPL-2.0-or-later and AGPL-3.0-or-later, or says \"open source (GPL and AGPL)\". A page that mentions GPL (or General Public License) but never AGPL (or Affero) fails. D-16 (Tom, 2026-11-05)",
